  "title": "Optimism Network Fees",
  "description": "Optimism Network – Simple, Affordable Ethereum Scaling\nOptimism is another major Ethereum Layer 2, focused on speed and lower fees. Transa...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZKW1XQ7XCCAY515B53\">Optimism Network – Simple, Affordable Ethereum Scaling</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Optimism is another major Ethereum Layer 2, focused on speed and lower fees. Transactions settle on Ethereum but cost much less.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZK0CK4YV6YSCM5BPN3\">How Optimism Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees are based on:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas price (gwei)</b> times</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Amount of gas used</b></p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge calculates optimized fee suggestions for you automatically.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZKZXHXFEC4M41PPGE8\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Faster confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Balanced fee</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest, slower confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Full manual control for gas settings</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZKSS8RA3FX75YTWYQ6\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Usually around <b>$0.01 to $0.05 USD</b> per transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZKRNE9JP8TPJ1P6740\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Optimism makes Ethereum accessible without high fees. Edge handles the real-time adjustments so you just pick your speed and go.</p><hr><h1 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZKWY42FK23A7R8BS75\">Polygon (Matic) Network Fees – Ultra-Cheap and Fast</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Polygon is a highly popular Ethereum-compatible network with extremely low fees and very fast block times.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZKNRYJ7ZKKCCPQPSD4\">How Polygon Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas price (in gwei)</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network congestion</b></p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees are still paid in MATIC token but are much cheaper than Ethereum.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZKNSNEDBCQ5V948WM0\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Fastest confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Smart middle ground</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest, slow confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Full control over gas settings</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZKED01FAW0QKKMRKNF\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically around <b>$0.002 to $0.01 USD</b> per transaction — fractions of a cent!</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZKCX8TVHYQBR96VGS4\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Polygon is perfect for cheap everyday use, gaming, NFTs, and DeFi. Edge Wallet simplifies picking the right fee so you stay fast without overpaying</p>",
